      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, I think this is actually correct. These are two distinct states and an interface that is newly added will always start out as STATE_LINK_DOWN. The kernel sends two distinct RTM_NEWLINK events for this. And there is also the case where an interface is added without link (at the point of receiving STATE_LINK_DOWN, we do not know yet if we will ever receive a STATE_LINK_UP event for the interface).",
